{
  "name": "Sync Todoist tasks to Notion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0122196d-e051-4154-9e39-3ddbfe26858f",
      "name": "On schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        640,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "seconds"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "1a15e1cc-cdd5-4a49-aa7a-a0779f858e69",
      "name": "Get all tasks with specific label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.todoist",
      "position": [
        860,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "filters": {
          "labelId": "send-to-notion"
        },
        "operation": "getAll",
        "authentication": "oAuth2"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "35b13f4a-da38-4d63-9fbf-7c36c97cbc11",
      "name": "Add to Notion database",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "position": [
        1080,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "title": "={{ $json.content }}",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_RESOURCE"
        },
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "REPLACE_WITH_KEY",
              "numberValue": "={{ parseInt($json.id) }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "f3144751-28b0-48e1-9331-f25f55a5ddf6",
      "name": "Replace label on task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.todoist",
      "position": [
        1300,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "taskId": "={{ $('Get all tasks with specific label').item.json.id }}",
        "operation": "update",
        "updateFields": {
          "labels": [
            "sent"
          ],
          "description": "=Notion Link:  {{ $json.url }}\n\n{{ $('Get all tasks with specific label').item.json.description }}"
        },
        "authentication": "oAuth2"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "9155abd9-c1bc-531d-8db8-fbae1e64abb1",
      "name": "Publication · Overview and setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Sync Todoist tasks to Notion\n\n## Purpose and structure\nThis folder contains the **Sync Todoist tasks to Notion** workflow. Its executable nodes use `notion`, `scheduleTrigger`, `todoist`. The table and connection map below are derived from the JSON, not an inferred guarantee of behavior.\n\n## Setup\nImport inactive. Configure your own credentials and replace REPLACE_WITH_* values. Review external destinations and Code nodes before running.\n\n## Entry points\nOn schedule\n\n## Verification\nSanitized source candidate; not runtime-tested. This overview is generated from node metadata. Read the folder README for the connection map, credential types, and license.\n\n## Attribution\nhttps://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows/blob/94007c1445d9258a7da116646b79473e7c7c3282/workflows/Schedule/1607_Schedule_Notion_Sync_Scheduled.json\nMIT; preserve source notices.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 800,
        "color": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "On schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get all tasks with specific label",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Add to Notion database": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Replace label on task",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get all tasks with specific label": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Add to Notion database",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
